                                    "code": "/* mrelwood_GoldComp4 — RNBO codebox~ port of mrelwood source.\n * Stereo in1/in2 -> out1/out2; original slider units and defaults.\n * Graphics and GUI meters omitted. See RNBO/README.md and VALIDATION.md.\n * desc: GoldComp 4  [mrelwood]\n * \n *  \n * // (Copyright) 2025 - mrelwood plugins\n * //\n * //  This program is a free software plugin: you can redistribute it and/or modify\n * //  it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by\n * //  the Free Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or\n * //  (at your option) any later version.\n * //\n * //  This plugin is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,\n * //  but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of\n * //  MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\n * //  GNU General Public License for more details.\n * //  <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\n * \n *  \n * \n * // For oversample.jsfx-inc \"2x oversampler\":\n * // Copyright (C) 2015-2017 Theo Niessink <theo@taletn.com>\n * // This work is free. You can redistribute it and/or modify it under the\n * // terms of the Do What The Fuck You Want To Public License, Version 2,\n * // as published by Sam Hocevar. See http://www.wtfpl.net/ for more details.\n * \n * // Also used: st-oversampler.jsfx-inc \"Oversampler library\" by Sault\n * \n * \n * \n * \n * //\n */\n// -Stereo (L/R - M/S)\n@param({ min: 0, max: 1 }) slider2 = .5;\n// -L/R Link\n@param({ min: 0, max: 1 }) slider3 = .7;\n// -Side thr offset\n@param({ min: -15, max: 0 }) slider4 = -6;\n// -Threshold (dB)\n@param({ min: -48, max: 0 }) slider5 = 0;\n// -Knee (dB)\n@param({ min: -24, max: -6 }) slider6 = -12;\n// -Attack (ms/12dB)\n@param({ min: .02, max: 50 }) slider7 = 5;\n// -Ratio\n@param({ min: 1, max: 12 }) slider8 = 4;\n// -Release (ms/12dB)\n@param({ min: 10, max: 2000 }) slider9 = 120;\n// -Opto Release (FET - Opto)\n@param({ min: 0, max: 1 }) slider10 = 1;\n// -OverSampling\n@param({ min: 0, max: 6 }) slider11 = 0;\n// -RMS Target (dB)\n@param({ min: -36, max: -6 }) slider12 = -24;\n// -Output Trim (dB)\n@param({ min: -24, max: 24 }) slider13 = 0;\n// -Limiter\n@param({ min: 0, max: 1 }) slider15 = 1;\n// -Detector HP\n@param({ min: 20, max: 1000 }) slider16 = 20;\n// -Mix\n@param({ min: 0, max: 100 }) slider17 = 100;\n// -Tilt EQ\n@param({ min: -12, max: 12 }) slider20 = 0;\n// -NegExp (Ratio)\n@param({ min: 1, max: 4 }) slider21 = 1;\n@state ram = new FixedFloat64Array(1);\n@state s_initialized = 0;\n@state frame: Int = 0;\n@state prepared = 0;\n@state s__rel = 0;\n@state s__tgttgt = 0;\n@state s_attdb = 0;\n@state s_attms = 0;\n@state s_attmul = 0;\n@state s_atts = 0;\n@state s_buff = 0;\n@state s_cQ = 0;\n@state s_ca0 = 0;\n@state s_ca1 = 0;\n@state s_ca1a0 = 0;\n@state s_ca2 = 0;\n@state s_ca2a0 = 0;\n@state s_cb0 = 0;\n@state s_cb0a0 = 0;\n@state s_cb1 = 0;\n@state s_cb1a0 = 0;\n@state s_cb2 = 0;\n@state s_cb2a0 = 0;\n@state s_clnL = 0;\n@state s_clnM = 0;\n@state s_clnR = 0;\n@state s_clnS = 0;\n@state s_comix = 0;\n@state s_dbmin = 0;\n@state s_fltin = 0;\n@state s_fltinbal = 0;\n@state s_ftmp = 0;\n@state s_in1 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x0 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x1 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x2 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x3 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x4 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x5 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x6 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x7 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x8 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_x9 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y0 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y1 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y10 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y11 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y12 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y13 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y14 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y15 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y16 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y17 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y18 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y2 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y3 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y4 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y5 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y6 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y7 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y8 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os2_y9 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os4_x0 = 0;\n@state s_in1_os4_x1 = 0;\n@sta